#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0041A expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
#note "Neither name ends with DT (ADTM ends with TM, ADY with DY) although both lack a format entirely, so the rule stays silent. Pins the suffix boundary against PMDA-AD0043A from this side."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col ADTM    type=Num
col ADY     type=Num
---
S1 | 001 | ALB | 1900000 | 5
---
